Tool Z-profile: f32 fn(r: f32) → Z added to cutter tip Z, plus a max-radius. Per tool kind:
- Endmill (flat-bottom cylinder): 0 if r ≤ R else +inf
- Ball nose: R - sqrt(R² - r²) if r ≤ R else +inf
- V-bit / engraver: r * tan(half_angle) if r ≤ R; tip_diameter offsets the apex
- Drag knife: punt to Endmill in v1
- Drill: same as Endmill (cylindrical column on plunge)

Tests:
- new() initializes every cell to top_z
- lower_at only writes when new < current (so bumps from later-passed-over cells don't 'rise')
- sample() does bilinear interpolation; values match analytic profiles for endmill / ball-nose / V-bit at r=0, R/2, R
- reset clears all cells + clears dirty AABB
- dirty AABB tracks the bounding box of every cell mutated since clear_dirty

