Fields:
- Data (text input, multi-line for long URLs).
- Module size (mm; default 1 mm).
- Error correction level (radio: L / M / Q / H; default M).
- Include quiet zone (checkbox; default on).
- Position (X / Y).
- Operation: dropdown `Pocket` / `Engrave` / `RasterEngrave` (when Child 12 ships) / `Plain (geometry only)`. Default Pocket if any endmill is in the tool library, else Engrave.

